WEBVTT

00:38:57.670 --> 00:39:00.424
by reflecting on why
you're in this job to begin with.

00:39:00.448 --> 00:39:01.826
(Music)

00:39:01.850 --> 00:39:04.667
What does it mean to you
and to the people around you?

00:39:04.691 --> 00:39:06.366
(Music)

00:39:06.390 --> 00:39:07.776
It's only a starting point,

00:39:07.800 --> 00:39:09.134
but it can make a difference

00:39:09.158 --> 00:39:12.337
to remember how your work
makes a difference.

00:39:12.686 --> 00:39:19.686
(Music)

00:39:19.710 --> 00:39:21.146
Next week on WorkLife.

00:39:21.170 --> 00:39:24.756
Grace Song: I was the lowest-paid employee
in my department of 250 people,

00:39:24.780 --> 00:39:28.356
even though I was
the highest-rated performer

00:39:28.380 --> 00:39:30.006
within my band levels.